{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/EUsy4qtf4bST-AVDMJCfcQ","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T17:02:50.030410+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/EUsy4qtf4bST-AVDMJCfcQ","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span><span>根据教育部相关工作要求以及《中国社会科学院大学</span></span><span><span>2026</span></span><span><span>年接收推荐免试攻读研究生招生工作办法》相关规定，结合哲学院具体情况，现就我学院</span></span><span><span>2026</span></span><span><span>年接收推荐免试攻读研究生（以下简称推免生）工作的相关事宜通知如下：</span></span></span></p><p><b><span><span><span>一、接收推免生的专业和名额</span></span></span></b></p><p><span><span><span>中国社会科学院大学哲学院</span></span><b><span><span>2026</span></span><span><span>年拟接收优秀应届本科生免试攻读硕士学位研究生</span></span><span><span>15</span></span><span><span>人，拟接收免试攻读博士学位研究生（直博生）</span></span><span><span>8</span></span><span><span>人</span></span></b><span><span>。我学院接收推免生的专业和名额在《</span></span><b><span><span>中国社会科学院大学哲学院</span></span><span><span>2026</span></span><span><span>年硕士研究生招生专业目录</span></span></b><span><span>》和《</span></span><b><span><span>2026</span></span><span><span>年中国社会科学院大学哲学院拟接收推免生（含直博生）专业目录</span></span></b><span><span>》中公布。《</span></span><span><span>2026</span></span><span><span>年中国社会科学院大学哲学院拟接收推免生（含直博生）专业目录》</span></span></span><span><span><span>见附件</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>各专业实际招收人数将根据生源情况进行调整。如未完成推免接收计划，剩余名额将用于统考招生。</span></span></span></p><p><b><span><span><span>二、申请条件和要求</span></span></span></b></p><p><b><span><span><span>（一）申请推荐免试硕士生</span></span></span></b></p><p><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span><span><span><span>中华人民共和国公民。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span><span><span><span>拥护中国共产党的领导，品德良好，遵纪守法。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>3.</span></span></span><span><span><span>获得所在高校当年正式推免资格，并在教育部“推免服务系统”完成注册。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>4.</span></span></span><span><span><span>身体健康状况符合国家和我校规定的体检要求。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>5.</span></span></span><span><span><span>学习成绩优秀，学术研究兴趣浓厚，具有较强的创新意识、创新能力和专业能力。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>6.</span></span></span><span><span><span>诚实守信，学风端正，无考试作弊、剽窃他人学术成果及任何违法违纪受处分记录。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>7.</span></span></span><span><span><span>符合我学院提出的相关学术要求。</span></span></span></p><p><b><span><span><span>（二）申请直博生</span></span></span></b></p><p><span><span><span>直博生是指从优秀的具备推荐免试研究生资格的应届本科毕业生（简称推免生）中选拔出来直接攻读博士学位的研究生。直博生学习年限不低于五年。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>除须满足上述（一）中各项条件外，还应达到如下条件：</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span><span><span><span>申请者须学习成绩优秀，专业学业成绩名列本专业或年段前茅，一般应在前</span></span><span><span>20%</span></span><span><span>以内。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span><span><span><span>申请者具有较高的外语水平，</span></span></span><span><span><span>要求参加国家英语六级考试且成绩达到</span></span><span><span>520</span></span><span><span>分（含）以上</span></span><span><span><span>（或具备同等水平的其他种类外语国家级考试成绩）</span><span>[1]</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>3.</span></span></span><span><span><span>具有较强的独立调查研究、综合分析问题、解决问题的能力。</span></span></span></p><p><b><span><span><span>三、申报流程</span></span></span></b></p><p><b><span><span><span>（一）申请者向我学院提交预申请材料。</span></span></span></b><span><span><span>申请人</span></span></span><b><u><span><span><span>将电子版申请材料按顺序汇总为一个</span></span><span><span>pdf</span></span><span><span>文档，以“</span></span><span><span>2026-</span></span><span><span>姓名</span></span><span><span>-</span></span><span><span>预推免报考专业”命名，于</span></span><span><span>2025</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>17</span></span><span><span>日（周三）中午</span></span><span><span>12:00</span></span><span><span>之前发送到邮箱</span></span><span><span>xiedh-zxs@cass.org.cn</span></span></span></u></b><span><span><span>。如因特殊原因无法及时提交材料应联系学院并说明情况。注意留存材料纸质原件或证书复印件，根据学院后续通知提交纸质版。</span></span></span><span><span><span>对不符合规定或弄虚作假者，一经查实，取消资格。材料清单如下：</span></span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span><span><span><span>《</span></span><b><span><span>中国社会科学院大学</span></span><span><span>2026</span></span><span><span>年接收推荐免试攻读硕士（博士）学位申请表</span></span></b><span><span>》（须加盖推荐高校教务管理部门公章）（见附件</span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>，可在中国社会科学院哲学研究所网下载）；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span><span><span><span>有效期内的</span><span>身份证</span><span>、每学期均注册的</span><span>学生证复印件</span><span>；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>3.</span></span></span><span><span><span>本科阶段历年</span><span>学习成绩单和排名证明</span><span>（须加盖推荐高校教务处公章）；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>4.</span></span></span><span><span><span>提交国家</span><span>英语四六级考试成绩单</span><span>，或其他外语水平证明材料；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>5.</span></span></span><span><span><span>公开发表的论文、著（译）作，如无公开发表的科研成果，可提供</span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>篇能够体现自身学术水平、科研能力的代表性学术论文、出版物或原创性工作成果等其它材料；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>6.</span></span></span><span><span><span>个人简历等</span><span>自我评价材料；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>7.</span></span></span><span><span><span>报考导师意向表</span><span>（见附件</span></span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span>，可在中国社会科学院哲学研究所网下载）；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>8.</span></span></span><span><span><span>获奖证书</span><span>；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>9.</span></span></span><span><span><span>申请直博生提供两位报考专业所在一级学科领域内教授或相当职称专家出具的</span><span>推荐信</span><span>（见附件</span></span><span><span>4</span></span><span><span>，可在中国社会科学院哲学研究所网下载）。</span></span></span></p><p><b><span><span><span>（二）教育部推免服务系统报名。</span></span></span></b><span><span><span>教育部“全国推荐免试攻读研究生（免初试、转段）信息公开管理服务系统”（以下简称“全国推免服务系统”）为推免工作统一的信息备案公开平台和网上报考录取系统。申请我学院的考生除向学院提出预申请、提交材料外，还须在规定的时间内登录全国推免服务系统，注册和填写基本信息，完成网上报名、网上缴费、确认复试通知和待录取通知等环节。</span></span></span></p><p><b><span><span><span>四、复试安排</span></span></span></b></p><p><b><span><span><span>（一）资格审查</span></span></span></b></p><p><span><span><span>我学院根据推免生提交的材料进行审核并择优确定复试考生。复试名单将于</span></span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>18</span></span><span><span>日后在中国社会科学院哲学研究所网站公布。</span></span></span></p><p><b><span><span><span>（二）复试形式</span></span></span></b><span></span></p><p><span><span><span>我学院</span></span><span><span>2026</span></span><span><span>年推免招生复试工作采取网络远程复试的方式进行，拟使用腾讯会议软件，于</span></span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>20</span></span><span><span>日前进行线上综合面试，复试时间和具体安排另行通知。请申请人及时查看邮件和接听电话。</span></span><u></u></span></p><p><b><span><span><span>五、复试考核办法</span></span></span></b></p><p><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span><span><span><span>复试为综合面试，包括专业面试、外语听力和口试、综合素质面试。复试总分</span></span><span><span>300</span></span><span><span>分，合格线为</span></span><span><span>180</span></span><span><span>分。具体包括专业素质和能力总分</span></span><span><span>150</span></span><span><span>分，合格线</span></span><span><span>90</span></span><span><span>分；综合素质和能力（包括外语听力和口试</span></span><span><span>50</span></span><span><span>分、综合素质面试等）总分</span></span><span><span>150</span></span><span><span>分，合格线</span></span><span><span>90</span></span><span><span>分。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span><span><span><span>复试要对推免生的学习能力、科研能力、创新精神、工作能力、思想品德等诸方面进行全面考核，重点考察学生科研创新潜力，对学科的认识、学科知识的综合应用能力，考生知识结构及背景等。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>3.</span></span></span><span><span><span>对于思想品德方面的考核，要求出具推免生所在学校的政审意见；体检应在学院确定拟录取之后，在二级甲等及以上医院或专业体检机构完成，将体检结果交报考学院。</span></span></span></p><p><b><span><span><span>六、接收原则及要求</span></span></span></b></p><p><span><span><span>在申请人数充足的情况下，复试实行差额复试，择优录取。具体差额比例根据专业自身特点和生源状况确定。推免生应在学院规定的时间内确认是否接受我校发送的待录取通知，逾期未确认者视为放弃。拟录取名单需经学校审定并进行公示。</span></span></span></p><p><b><span><span><span>七、联系方式</span></span></span></b><b><span></span></b></p><p><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span><span>．中国社会科学院大学（研究生院）地址：北京市房山区良乡高教园区长于大街</span></span><span><span>11</span></span><span><span>号中国社会科学院大学，网址：</span></span><span><span>https://www.ucass.edu.cn/</span></span><span><span>，校招生办联系电话：</span></span><span><span>010-81360224</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span><span><span><span>哲学专业招生联系地址：北京市东城区建国门内大街</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>号中国社会科学院哲学研究所，网址：http://philosophy.cass.cn/zxx/zxxjs/</span></span></span><span><span><span>，联系人：谢老师，联系电话：</span></span><span><span>010-85195505</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>010-65138373</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>3.</span></span></span><span><span><span>宗教学专业招生联系地址：北京市东城区建国门内大街</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>号中国社会科学院世界宗教研究所，网址：http://iwr.cass.cn/</span></span></span><span><span><span>，联系人：苏老师，联系电话：</span></span><span><span>010-85195477</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>4.</span></span></span><span><span><span>哲学院联系地址：北京市房山区良乡高教园区长于大街</span></span><span><span>11</span></span><span><span>号中国社会科学院大学哲学院，网址：https://phil.ucass.edu.cn/</span></span></span><span><span><span>，联系人：于老师，联系电话：</span></span><span><span>010-81360411</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span> </span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>附件</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>：</span></span><span><span>2026</span></span><span><span>年中国社会科学院大学哲学院拟接收推免生（含直博生）专业目录</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>附件</span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>：</span></span></span><span><span><span>中国社会科学院大学</span></span><span><span>2026</span></span><span><span>年接收推荐免试攻读硕士（博士）学位申请表</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>附件</span></span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span>：报考导师意向表</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>附件</span></span><span><span>4</span></span><span><span>：中国社会科学院大学报考免试攻读博士学位研究生专家推荐书</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span> </span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>中国社会科学院大学哲学院</span></span></span></p><section><span><span><span>2025</span></span></span><span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>12</span></span><span><span>日</span></span></span></section><p><span><br/></span></p><hr/><p><span><span><span><span>[1]</span></span></span></span><span> <span>1.</span></span><span><span>英语应达到以下要求之一：</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>）国家英语六级考试成绩</span></span><span><span>520</span></span><span><span>分（含）以上；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>GRE</span></span><span><span>成绩</span></span><span><span>310</span></span><span><span>分（含）以上；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>TOEFL</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>IBT</span></span><span><span>）成绩</span></span><span><span>100</span></span><span><span>分（含）以上；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>4</span></span><span><span>）雅思（</span></span><span><span>A</span></span><span><span>类）成绩</span></span><span><span>6.5</span></span><span><span>分（含）以上；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>）英语专业八级合格及以上；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>GMAT</span></span><span><span>成绩</span></span><span><span>650</span></span><span><span>分及以上；</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span>俄语应达到以下条件之一：</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>）专业俄语八级合格证书；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>）俄罗斯联邦对外俄语等级考试二级及以上。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.</span></span><span><span>日语应达到以下条件之一：</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>）专业日语八级合格证书；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>）日本语能力测试（</span></span><span><span>JLPT</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>N2</span></span><span><span>及以上。</span></span></p><p><span><span>4.</span></span><span><span>德语应达到以下条件之一：</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>）专业德语八级合格证书；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span><span>德福（</span></span><span><span>TestDaF</span></span><span><span>）总分</span></span><span><span>16</span></span><span><span>分及以上</span></span></span><span><span>；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span>）德国高校外国申请者入学德语考试证书（</span></span><span><span>DSH</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>级及以上。</span></span></p><p><span><span>5.</span></span><span><span>法语应达到以下条件之一：</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>）专业法语八级合格证书；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>TCF</span></span><span><span>或</span></span><span><span>TEF</span></span><span><span>达到</span></span><span><span>B2</span></span><span><span>级及以上；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>DELF-DALF</span></span><span><span>达到</span></span><span><span>B2</span></span><span><span>级及以上。</span></span></p><p><span><span>6.</span></span><span><span>阿拉伯语、西班牙语、朝鲜语、波斯语等其他语种：学生须提供国家级语言考试（中国举办或该语言国举办）的通过证书或合格成绩单，成绩需达到相当于我国英语水平考试中的六级水平。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><br/></span></span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span><span>【</span><strong><span>相关文档下载请点击下方“阅读原文”</span></strong><span>】</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span><br/></span></span></strong></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/sAzeicHtRslg0OoRHYovbhkiavShoxSLS5u9MiaDeb4kEwOAM6ItkPUBBn9MDIYicuVYnJ6ACiczaQTnCZCOLgkAZDA/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"a7a0b4d43a8ea4d252ca45c28226ba7afd4fddc5a0ad473b74146a9df383230d","textLength":3144,"sourceSha256":"3faf494cf4f2a95b4078488e32b02cdcbc993ce502f262c14a93d3f2cc599197","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-bff7f05f6e76e2218e28","title":"2025年中国社会科学院大学哲学院关于接收2026年推荐免试攻读研究生（含直博生）的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T17:02:50.030410+00:00"}
